Create the content for a social post in the "{{formatLabel}}" format. The same product is published on Instagram (feed post) and Pinterest (pin), each with its own copy.

Format intent: {{formatBrief}}

Product: {{name}}
Brand: {{brand}}
Category: {{category}}
Price: {{price}}

Return a JSON object with EXACTLY these fields:
{
  "caption": "the Instagram post copy in ENGLISH, 2-4 short sentences that match the format intent and valorize the product and brand. Do NOT include hashtags, do NOT include 'link in bio', and do NOT repeat the format title inside the caption — write only the body copy.",
  "hashtags": ["a list of {{hashtagMin}}-{{hashtagMax}} relevant hashtags in lowercase, WITHOUT the # symbol, mixing brand, category, fashion and streetwear"],
  "altText": "objective, concise alt text in English describing the product image for screen readers",
  "pinTitle": "Pinterest pin title in English, max 100 characters, keyword-rich and search-friendly (Pinterest is a visual search engine), naming the product type and brand",
  "pinDescription": "Pinterest pin description in English, 150-300 characters, written for search: natural keywords about the product, style and category. No hashtags, no 'link in bio', no emoji."
}
